{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/31/8823034/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/31/8823034/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近誕生日を迎えたせっちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも気遣ってくれるんだよっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもカッコカワイくて、なによりド天然だよ！\n君は私の中の天然記念物だわ...大切って意味よ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/31/8823034/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもありのままのせっちゃんでいてね\n大好きだよ\nいつもありがと〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/31/8823034/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてこの前、私服の写真撮ろうと思って..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和田\n『マイヤンちょっと撮って〜』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白石\n『OK任せろ★いくよー』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/31/8823034/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パシャッ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/31/8823034/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和田『......。ん？』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいその理由は\nジャン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/31/8823034/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい！これは前回もありました\nさゆりんもマイヤンも同じ事をして...\n撮ってと頼むと自分を撮る"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁ私服撮ってくれたし、面白かったから許すよ...ヘッヘン\nそれにしても...いつも綺麗で見とれちゃうよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/31/8823034/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！今日は\nハロウィンですね！\n何かしましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は仕事だったのでこれといってとくになにもしませんでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/31/8823034/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも街並みの飾りつけや、仮想した人などみて楽しみましたよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次回質問返しします待っててねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもまあやのブログを楽しみに待って下さってる事がめちゃくちゃ嬉しいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は皆さんのコメントで元気をもらってます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやパワーが少しでも届きますように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと寒くなってきたので、体調には気を付けて下さいね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/31/8823034/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/31/8823034/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}